   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Easy Answers**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Milestones**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Mighty Quinn**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **dac2021-08-28.AKGmix.toaste.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 183 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Because of a curfew, the band stayed on stage and did not leave before the encore [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **dac2021-08-28.AKGmix.toaste.flac16**: taped by Toaste; transferred by Toaste; source: 1x AKG393 Hypercardioid (C); 1x AKG394 Figure-8 (L,R); 2x AKG391 cardioids DIN (L,R); 2x AKG392 omnis 20-inch spread (L,R) > Zoom F8 @ 44.1/16 [1]. Also: Taped from OTS, section A, row 27, seat 33, with a mix of AKG cardioid, hypercardioid, figure-8 and omni mics into a Zoom F8 at 44.1/16; Unmixed individual tracks of this recording are also available for anyone wanting to make their own mix [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by Worthpoint: [DEAD AND COMPANY HERSHEY PARK STADIUM EVENT POSTER xxxx/1260 PHISH WEIR | #3864146386](https://www.worthpoint.com/worthopedia/dead-company-hershey-park-stadium-3864146386) [3]\n- Fan art by Worthpoint: [DEAD AND COMPANY HERSHEY PARK STADIUM EVENT POSTER xxxx/1260 PHISH WEIR | #3864146386](https://www.worthpoint.com/worthopedia/dead-company-hershey-park-stadium-3864146386) [4]",
